    "method": "Manual marker centers on the enlarged Fig. 6 raster. Fit a 3D pinhole projection to seven visible cuboid corners in normalized coordinates, calibrate x and y using the printed floor ticks (logarithmic radiance axis in d–f), and solve LPIPS by projection onto the vertical ray for the known x/y. Compare only endpoint anchors (start shifted to the first unambiguous front row marker in a).",
